OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome brightness at first but cloud and
OL,7,Fshowery outbreaks of rain soon push in
OL,8,Ffrom the south overnight. The odd
OL,9,Fheavy burst possible, most likely for
OL,10,FTyrone and Fermanagh. Remaining breezy
OL,11,Faround the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with patchy rain or
OL,14,Fshowers at first, some heavy bursts
OL,15,Fpossible for Tyrone and Fermanagh.
OL,16,FSkies generally brightening in the
OL,17,Fafternoon but still the chance of the
OL,18,Fodd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
