OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with occasional rain or
OL,7,Fshowers, the rain perhaps heavy and
OL,8,Fthundery. Often cloudy but with some
OL,9,Fdrier and brighter spells breaking
OL,10,Fthrough at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
